Warning [L0503] (compound_assignment): Prefer `p.hp -= …` instead of repeating the left side
  --> tests/ui_lint/prefer_compound_assign.jet:5:43
    |
  5 | fn damage(p: &Player, amount: Int) { p.hp = p.hp - amount }
    |                                           ^
 Why: Compound assignment updates a place in one step without restating it
 Fix: Write `p.hp -= …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0503

